5189_4915271146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S-aLsyUEm5cQ7kNvwGRSWxr&_nc_oc=AdoMKawLTgMw5aecVUjfvI4UHVW-rKs7XrzK2_3ycSYkLkeMsw05D93cjkWGergaRdA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-NUbsd_SXrJ-8zSHGEr7ifVsNMTtSRug603I_Y5cJs8Q&oe=6A369139"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MUf0i8ANv_8Q7kNvwEvEA-f&_nc_oc=AdpLjZY9HY_SnkWqz-DElOa2yFdY7yVMqQWQMnlA3tS6MK_zDAyCvpD_2SQAT8gYXQk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8StPxHNWKTbUQ71PEfEAlGXT7PhJYMPr40kgBRdd6xmw&oe=6A36A413"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s98VG20cCZYQ7kNvwGM4T40&_nc_oc=AdoAB_cSCJmNjlpPl7tAA_FHfAZboJ5SYYEEISM_jP6SXNzkGnxVIDGINiA7rnzkZBg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-krnyI2-SgrKKhF1MY_ed8fRhjwdC_hQCkOQKAcbc6zQ&oe=6A36A25A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_u